<section class="section" id="about">
  <div class="heading">
    <h2 class="text--xl font--heading font--bold">
      Hi!
      <span role="img" aria-label="waving hand" class="waveEmoji" data-animate>
        👋
      </span>
    </h2>
    <p class="text--md font--heading aligned--left">
      I'm a web developer fascinated with electronics, programming, and all
      things healthcare.
    </p>
    <p class="text--md font--heading aligned--left">
      My most recent hobbies have been running some self-hosted projects
      like <a href="https://www.home-assistant.io/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Home Assistant</a>, <a href="https://nextcloud.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">NextCloud</a>, and <a href="https://jellyfin.org/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Jellyfin</a>. Other ways I love to spend time are playing with my dogs, reading,
      and making music.
    </p>
    <p class="text--md font--heading aligned--left">
      {% if availability.isAvailable %}
        <span>I'm</span> currently available for part-time
        freelance projects. If you'd like to work together, please reach
        out using the contact information below.
      {% else %}
        I'm <span>NOT</span> currently available for
        freelance work, but if you have a project I'm happy to recommend
        other developers who might suit your needs.
      {% endif %}
    </p>
  </div>
  {% include "components/priorities.njk" %}
</section>
